// Issue #69 — Command-Point + Deployment-Point smoke fixture.
//
// A known active fleet + known player skills so the DP cap and CP pool
// formulas are deterministic:
//   - flagship = lightFreighter (dpCost 3), parked at Von Braun.
//   - escort A = lunarMilitia   (dpCost 2), docked at Von Braun.
//   - escort B = pegasusClass   (dpCost 10), docked at Von Braun.
//   - player piloting XP = 5000 → level 50 (XP is cumulative; level =
//     floor(xp / 100); see src/character/skills.ts). piloting is the
//     shipped combat-skill stand-in for the deferred shipCommand / tactics
//     skills (Design/characters/skills.md + fleetCommandPoints.ts header).
//
// With piloting level 50 and no flagship comm officer assigned, the
// formulas (fleet.json5) evaluate to:
//   dpCap          = 6 + floor(50/20) + 0                 = 8
//   maxCommandPnts = floor(4 + 50/25 + 50/30 + 0)         = 7
//
// The test promotes A + B into the active fleet (war room), then commits
// against the DP cap: A(2)+flagship-implicit fits under 8; adding B(10)
// blows the cap and is refused. The combat phase then asserts the CP pool
// matches the formula, debits on a fleet order, refuses when dry, and that
// a cautious vs. aggressive escort close/hold differently.
{
  seed: 'cp-dp-001',
  startDate: '2026-05-17T08:00:00Z',
  scene: 'vonBraunCity',

  player: {
    money: 2000000,
    location: { scene: 'vonBraunCity', x: 32, y: 18 },
    skills: { piloting: 5000 },
  },

  ships: [
    {
      // Explicit flagship: true (not just i===0) so applyShips seeds the
      // flagship's interior layout (rooms + kiosks) at boot — Task 4's
      // war-room-dp smoke walks onto the bridge's warRoom kiosk and needs a
      // walkable interior without boarding first.
      id: 'ship',
      template: 'lightFreighter',
      name: '自由号',
      dockedAt: 'vonBraun',
      flagship: true,
    },
    {
      id: 'escort-a',
      template: 'lunarMilitia',
      name: '民兵甲',
      dockedAt: 'vonBraun',
    },
    {
      id: 'escort-b',
      template: 'pegasusClass',
      name: '飞马号',
      dockedAt: 'vonBraun',
    },
  ],
}
